# Styling & shadcn/ui

## Tailwind v4

- Global styles: `src/app/globals.css` — `@import 'tailwindcss'` + CSS variables (`:root`, `.dark`)
- Use semantic tokens: `bg-background`, `text-foreground`, `border-border`, `text-muted-foreground`
- Merge classes with `cn()` from `@/lib/utils` (clsx + tailwind-merge)

## shadcn/ui

- Config: `components.json` (style: new-york, RSC: true)
- Add components: `npx shadcn@latest add <name>` — place in `src/components/ui/`
- Extend variants via `class-variance-authority` (see `button.tsx`)

## Responsive & a11y

- Mobile: sidebar hidden on small screens; `Menu` toggles `useUiStore` for future sheet/drawer
- Interactive controls need visible focus (`focus-visible:ring-2`)
- Use `sr-only` for icon-only buttons

## Do not

- Introduce CSS-in-JS libraries or duplicate color tokens outside `globals.css`
- Use inline styles for layout that Tailwind utilities cover
